--
Phase-2 regression test: --proof-explanation works under --modular.

Reuses the F12Old test class (JVerify-style precondition /
postcondition / assigns + JVerify.old() in postcondition). Adds
--proof-explanation to the existing f12-old invocation and
verifies the explanation:
- includes the standard "Proof explanation:" / "Per-property
  proof explanations:" headers
- references the F12Old.java source

We deliberately don't pin the exact slice contents because
DFCC's modular substitution adds many synthetic
__CPROVER_contracts_* write-set steps; the test stays robust
against churn there. The doc-form (3) Tomb & Joshi static-
coverage layer (Phase 4) will produce per-clause warnings that
filter the synthetic steps out.
